{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","englishTitle":"If a magnitude be the same multiple of a magnitude that a part subtracted is of a part subtracted, the remainder will also be the same multiple of the remainder that the whole is of the whole.","book":5,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","contentId":"euclid-5-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"379142ad3404cb27504e453faf11c0aeaf14e3129b6869382104990910d1b4a5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-5.statement","euclid-5-5.construction.1","euclid-5-5.proof.1","euclid-5-5.proof.2","euclid-5-5.proof.3","euclid-5-5.proof.4","euclid-5-5.construction.2","euclid-5-5.proof.5","euclid-5-5.proof.6","euclid-5-5.proof.7","euclid-5-5.proof.8","euclid-5-5.conclusion","euclid-5-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81723e2f04aa693c95980ab0d536571c8024cea2b00b24f9d4103756cd7a9c3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a magnitude be the same multiple of a magnitude that a part subtracted is of a part subtracted, the remainder will also be the same multiple of the remainder that the whole is of the whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个数值是所减部分所减的同一数值的倍数,则其余数值也是整个数值的倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f62a80b636d83c304dd0b653579e66df4e04be1215b97c805860451eb68c391a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the magnitude AB be the same multiple of the magnitude CD that the part AE subtracted is of the part CF subtracted; I say that the remainder EB is also the same multiple of the remainder FD that the whole AB is of the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB星等与CD星等的倍数相同,减去的AE星等为CF部分减幅;我说,其余的EB星等也是其余的FD星等的倍数,整个AB星等为CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6cc1fd05d00bb984d83361c34ead7a21b46ddf781293d8c10177e50affb9c464","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, whatever multiple AE is of CF, let EB be made that multiple of CG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE的CF,EB的CG, 乘以AE"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3a9942c862172275d2d8e3ce69dfec825f4b8cfcc12d3abf975ce95024a5566","citations":["euclid-5-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AE is the same multiple of CF that EB is of GC, therefore AE is the same multiple of CF that AB is of GF. [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是CF的乘数,EB是GC,AE是CF的乘数,AB是GF。 [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8be36aa43bcd1afe83f62b3370239e5652d9cdffd56671e967baf0d2d20a640","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by the assumption, AE is the same multiple of CF that AB is of CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,根据假设,AE是CF的乘数,AB是CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"708581b0e4134e781b67b2b035d42a940c0b8c91691f00beb33ca6b524ae8346","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB is the same multiple of each of the magnitudes GF, CD; therefore GF is equal to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB是GF、CD等等等的同一个倍数;因此,GF等等于CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbc8708dee02931a62924136cf0ee21e9044dbd114c96dba125b7a2ab99cf7b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CF be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder GC is equal to the remainder FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人减去CF美元,其余GC美元等于其余FD美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42e71a9ed12de45d932240054fd1914ea607b99ead1c9693a0925877a124d6ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AE is the same multiple of CF that EB is of GC, and GC is equal to DF, therefore AE is the same multiple of CF that EB is of FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是CF的乘数,EB是GC,GC等于DF,AE是CF的乘数,EB是FD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1f15061d33fc2b62604aec00adf4c1357d8d9111c160310524a65967af7a525","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis,"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是假设"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"666e8d2bf2b4dc75a0054c804305e057dbbf69ba92f6dd1f41e5ae5cb88859af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"AE is the same multiple of CF that AB is of CD; therefore EB is the same multiple of FD that AB is of CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是CF的乘数,AB是CD;因此,EB是FD的乘数,AB是CD的乘数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aea541a76ac60588219c65b61e27cbcb13e61c1e5671c0a45eacfda50cd17264","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"That is, the remainder EB will be the same multiple of the remainder FD that the whole AB is of the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也就是说,其余EB将同其余FD中的数倍相同,即整个AB将占全部CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-5.source","contentId":"euclid-5-5","revisionId":"euclid-5-5@raw-379142ad3404cb27","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43efed8e07f5e4733b75159986a194163e61acf07bcb0d8736f92307464b2ee0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-5:euclid-5-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-5.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"V. 1"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-5:euclid-5-1:explicit","id":"euclid-5-1","book":5,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
